[38;5;196m+==========================[ 02 / WHAT IS THIS SHIT ]==========================+[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mHarvard + Anthropic + QuEra let Claude evolve circuits for 8 tasks,       [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mthen published the winners and the grader. Nice of them. We ran           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mtheir own grader, unmodified, on our circuits. It says OK. Eight          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mtimes.                                                                    [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThen we found two broken HHL circuits their grader ALSO says OK           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mto -- one of them "beat" our best at the time. So we fixed their          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mgrader too. You're welcome, Cambridge. Invoice is in the mail.            [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;88m+-x--x--x--------------------------------------------------------------x--x--x-+[0m
[38;5;250m[0m
[38;5;196m+==============[ 03 / THE STATE OF THE STATE OF THE ART ADDRESS ]==============+[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThank you. Thank you. Please, sit down. So many reviewers.                [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mTremendous reviewers. The best, frankly. Some, not so much.               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mReviewer 2, I see you. Sit down, Reviewer 2.                              [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThe state of the state of the art is strong. Very strong.                 [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mStronger than ever. People are saying it. Smart people.                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mHarvard people, even.                                                     [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mTwo days ago the state of the art was in Cambridge. Beautiful             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mplace. Lovely campus. Today it's in Lafayette, Louisiana. In a            [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mchat window. Nobody saw it coming. I didn't see it coming.                [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mWe beat them on eight tasks. Eight out of eight. Nobody's ever            [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mseen anything like it. They had the AI, the big search, the               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mwhole thing. Mythos. The big model. And we beat them on                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mmedium. MEDIUM. Can you believe it? Sad!                                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThe point adder? 64.9% cheaper. Sixty-four point nine. Many               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mpeople said it couldn't go lower. I said watch. Now it's lower.           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mFour million Toffolis, now under one million. 999,283. Some               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mpeople say we use more qubits. 1,317. They're right. Big qubits.          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThe biggest. And we still win on TQ. Easily.                              [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mWe found a qubit in chemistry. One qubit. Total disaster before.          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mNow it's back where it belongs. With us.                                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mHermitian: 25.8% cheaper. 59 failed shots, 100 allowed. Some              [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mpeople call that close. I call it under budget. UNDER BUDGET.             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mReed-Solomon: 0.08%. People laugh. Let them laugh. A win is a             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mwin. Ask anybody who ever lost by 0.08%.                                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mOvernight, while I slept, the machine cut five tasks. Five hours          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mand forty-nine minutes. No meetings. No standup. No PhD. Nobody           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252meven asked it to. Incredible machine.                                     [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThen the AI's own filter tried to stop the AI. Three times. On a          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mbenchmark! Somebody opened a new tab. It worked. Tabs 1, filter 0.        [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mAnd then -- this is true -- an AI from a whole other company came         [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252min and cut HHL and Coulomb again. One more qubit each. Bipartisan.        [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mCross-provider. They said it couldn't be done. Done.                      [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mTheir grader -- nice grader, I like the grader -- let two broken          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mcopies of their own circuit through. It checked 8,744 inputs out          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mof 2,031,616. We checked all of them. We fixed it. For free. Who          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mdoes that? Nobody. We do. You're welcome.                                 [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mTransparency. Very important. Very big. We're releasing                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252meverything. Every circuit. Every grade. Every method. Twenty-             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252meight techniques, all named. Even The Kaitlyn Proposal.                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mEspecially The Kaitlyn Proposal. Read the paper. Cite them by             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mname. It's the law. (It's not the law.)                                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mPrior art: we looked. We found some. We credited it. One of our           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mtricks was already in print, and we said so, in writing. Honest!          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mWho does that? Nobody does that.                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mAnd one more thing. Somebody else's code made our adder better.           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mTheir code had no license. So we didn't ship it. We read a paper          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252minstead, built our own square from it, and beat them. Licensed.           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mIntegrity AND Toffolis. Very rare. Tremendous integrity.                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mI don't know quantum physics. Nobody knows it. Okay? But I know           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mToffolis, and we have the fewest. The best Toffolis.                      [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mTo the authors: thank you for the grader. Now patch it.                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mTo Harvard: nice campus. To Reviewer 2: no.                               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThe state of the state of the art has never been stronger. It's           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mgoing to be even bigger next release. Believe me.                         [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mGod bless the grader, and God bless TQ.                                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
