[38;5;196m+=====================[ 05 / INCIDENT REPORT: THE FILTER ]=====================+[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mHour 38. The point adder is winning. The AI is winning.                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThen the AI's own safety filter reads the AI's homework and               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mpulls the fire alarm. Three times. On a benchmark. Graded by              [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252ma Harvard script. Running on zero existing quantum computers.             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mSabotage? Of course not. (It was obviously sabotage.)                     [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mSomewhere in San Francisco a filter saw the word secp256k1                [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mand fainted onto a fainting couch it keeps for this purpose.              [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThe AI then refused to write its own handoff note, out of                 [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mrespect for the filter, which immediately let the very next               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mwindow do the exact same work. Flawless. No notes.                        [38;5;238m :|[0m
