[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mverdict. COMMITMENTS.sha256 lists every hash in one place.                [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThe methods are in the white paper. The compiler is not.                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mThe bug proof needs no trust at all: reproducers/ and verifier/           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mrun against THEIR grader and THEIR circuit. Check us.                     [38;5;238m :|[0m
