[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: How?                                                                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Witchcraft.                                                            [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: No, seriously, how?                                                    [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Witchcraft. Same answer twice.                                         [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   The circuits are public. The methods are public. The compiler          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   isn't. Same witchcraft, now with a manual.                             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Do you even know quantum physics?                                      [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: No. I think a qubit is a bit that's also kind of not a bit.            [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   The grader never asked. It just counts Toffolis.                       [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: What's a Hamiltonian?                                                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: A musical. Next question.                                              [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Did you read the paper?                                                [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Claude read the paper. I read the abstract and the table               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   with the numbers we had to beat.                                       [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Is this legit?                                                         [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Their grader, their commit, unmodified. Same file, same 100,000        [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   shots, same verdict. Argue with the grader, not with us.               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Will you collapse a wavefunction for us?                               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: I can't even collapse a cardboard box for the recycling.               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Was this vibe coded?                                                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Every line. Vibes in, Toffolis out.                                    [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Is "vibe coding" a legitimate research methodology?                    [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Your grader said OK. Eight times. Take it up with the grader.          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Did you invent anything, or just remix?                                [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Both. The point adder runs on tricks we couldn't find in print.        [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   Now they're in print. Ours. See the white paper.                       [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: How did this get here?                                                 [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: We asked the same thing. Traced it back. The trail ends at a           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   Makefile and a guy who doesn't know what a Hamiltonian is.             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Who are you?                                                           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Some guy in Lafayette, LA. Not a physicist. Not a professor.           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   Not sure what he is, honestly. The grader says OK though.              [38;5;238m :|[0m
