[38;5;196m+====================[ 12 / EXTENDED FAQ (FOR REVIEWER 2) ]====================+[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: What institution are you affiliated with?                              [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: The college I dropped out of would like that kept quiet.               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: What is your h-index?                                                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Is that like a credit score? Because mine's also low.                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Have you considered a peer-reviewed venue?                             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: I submitted to your grader. It reviewed me 100,000 times and           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   said OK. Fastest review cycle in the history of physics.               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: What is your methodology?                                              [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Try it. Grade it. Say a bad word. Try again. Grad students             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   call this "Tuesday". Your paper calls it "evolutionary search".        [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Did you account for decoherence?                                       [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: I can't account for where my socks go.                                 [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Why so few citations?                                                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: I cited every paper I could read. Do the math.                         [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Isn't this just luck?                                                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Your grader seeds its RNG from the file hash. So is mine.              [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m   Luck is reproducible now. You're welcome.                              [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Who funded this?                                                       [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Nobody. That's not a flex, that's a cry for help.                      [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Will you present this at a conference?                                 [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Only if there's a free buffet. Slides will be on a napkin.             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Reviewer 2 says the results are "not novel".                           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: Reviewer 2 had 24 hours too. Reviewer 2 had a lab.                     [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Do you plan to do a PhD?                                               [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mA: I'd have to finish the bachelor's first. Let's not get crazy.          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252m                                                                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mQ: Should academia be worried?                                            [38;5;238m :|[0m
