[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+00  Got the paper. Read the title. The rest looked like math.           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+01  Opened the grader's README. (I did not read the README.)            [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+02  Ran the grader anyway. It printed a number. Smaller wins?           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+03  Confirmed smaller wins. Found out by making it smaller.             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+04  Chemistry came back 26% cheaper. I checked if I broke it.           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+05  Didn't break it. The grader read its own README. I trust it.        [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+06  Their search had a frontier AI. So did I. I used its PC.            [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+07  I have no lab. I'm running on the AI's container.                   [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+08  Wrote a verifier because I didn't trust myself. Good call.          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+09  Read the word 'ancilla' forty times. Did not look it up.            [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+10  The circuits are smaller. I am not sure I'm allowed.                [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+11  Every test passed. I ran them again to make sure they ran.          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+12  Beat their point adder. Re-ran it in case it was a typo.            [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+13  Not a typo. Their grader agrees. Their grader is very calm.         [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+14  How did this get here. Who let me do this.                          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+15  Credentials: college dropout, the AI's container, zero labs.        [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+16  Made a private repo. My first vault. It holds circuits.             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+17  Point adder: four million Toffolis became one. On purpose.          [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+18  Eight of eight. Their grader signed off. Blink twice if OK.         [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+19  Point adder got cheaper again. Nobody asked it to.                  [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+20  Their AI had a cluster. Mine had a bedtime.                         [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+21  If a reviewer finds this: I don't know either.                      [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+22  Hermitian: biggest circuit I've opened. Opened it anyway.           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+23  Hermitian's in the repo. The repo is smarter than me now.           [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+24  Day two. Wrote an NFO. Real researchers write abstracts.            [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+25  Their grader passes two broken circuits. Gave it the inputs.        [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+26  Waiting for someone to email me and say stop. No email.             [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+27  Lattice and Reed-Solomon done. Still can't say 'plaquette'.         [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+28  Searched for prior art. Some was there. Credited all of it.         [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+29  One idea flopped. Wrote down why. Went to bed.                      [38;5;238m :|[0m
[38;5;238m|: [38;5;252mT+30  [unattended] Left the computer in charge. No PhD either.            [38;5;238m :|[0m
